# Build trees. `build-host` is what the E-series builds on demand and
# `build-board` is the container's output; both are derived and neither is a
# deliverable — the deliverable is the source plus the pinned container.
build-host/
build-board/
build-*/

# The flashable image set. Hundreds of megabytes of derived partition images
# and build logs; what IS committed is image/image-manifest.json, which carries
# the defconfig, the SDK commit and the SHA-256 of every file here. The bytes
# are reproducible from the pinned container; the record of which bytes is not.
image/*
!image/image-manifest.json
